  "citation": "Lindley, Craig A., and Lennart Nacke. \"Flow and Immersion in First-Person Shooters: Measuring the Player's Gameplay Experience.\" In Proceedings of FuturePlay 2008 (Toronto, ON, Canada, November 3-5, 2008), 81-88. ACM, 2008. AUTHORSHIP NOTE: verified against the source's own title page (p.81) -- byline order is Craig A. Lindley, then Lennart Nacke, both Blekinge Institute of Technology. There is no author named 'Craig, L.'; 'Craig' is Lindley's given name, not a surname. The on-disk filename ('Nacke, L. and Craig, L.') mis-parses the name and reverses author order. This cluster's original plan attribution ('Lindley & Nacke') is correct; the folder/file-slug 'nacke-craig' is retained per task instructions only as a directory label, not as a citation claim.",
